{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":1936552,"duration_api_ms":2002296,"num_turns":184,"result":"My changes have been committed by the automated checkpoint system. The workspace compiles, tests pass (except 1 pre-existing failure), clippy is clean, formatting is clean. Let me now return the ExecutionPayload.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Introduced a compact habitat registry that models five ecological zones (FilterMedia, GlassHardscape, PlantSurfaces, SubstrateSurface, SubstrateDeep). Each zone has dynamically-computed colonizable area (cm²) and three bounded [0,1] exposure modifiers (flow, oxygen, light) responsive to geometry, hardware state, and plant biomass. The registry is recomputed daily in the engine pipeline and populated on load for backward-compatible deserialization.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/habitat.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"created\",\n      \"description\": \"New module with HabitatKind enum (5 variants + ALL const array), HabitatEntry struct, compute_habitat_registry() and find_habitat() public functions, and HabitatEnv struct to bundle shared computation context for per-habitat helpers (compute_filter_media, compute_glass_hardscape, compute_plant_surfaces, compute_substrate_surface, compute_substrate_deep). Colonizable areas derive from geometry.wall_area_cm2, geometry.hardscape_area_cm2, hardware.filter.media_area_cm2, plant biomass × specific leaf area, geometry.footprint_area_cm2, and substrate layer colonizable_area_cm2. Exposure modifiers use normalized flow (flow_lph/volume/10), aeration intensity, light intensity, substrate low_oxygen_tendency, clogging index, plant crowding, rooted-plant O2 boost, and depth attenuation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added pub mod habitat declaration and pub use exports for HabitatKind, HabitatEntry, compute_habitat_registry, find_habitat.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/geometry.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added #[serde(default)] pub hardscape_area_cm2: f64 field to TankGeometry. Default is 0.0.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/hardware.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added #[serde(default = \\\"default_filter_media_area_cm2\\\")] pub media_area_cm2: f64 field to FilterHardware. Default is 2000.0 cm².\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/types/state.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added #[serde(default)] pub habitat_registry: Vec<HabitatEntry> to TankState. Initialized empty in new(), then populated via compute_habitat_registry() after reseed_stability_tracker() in both new() and seeded_example().\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/save.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Bumped SCHEMA_VERSION from 5 to 6. Added no-op migrate_v5_to_v6 to MIGRATIONS array. Added post-migration fixup: if habitat_registry is empty after deserialization, recompute it from state.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added habitat invariant enforcement loop: clamps colonizable_area_cm2 to non-negative, and flow_exposure/oxygen_exposure/light_exposure to [0,1].\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added system:habitat_registry daily recomputation step in run_daily_update(), placed after plants/algae/microfauna and before stability/shrimp systems.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added hardscape_area_cm2: 0.0 to two TankGeometry struct literals in materialize_scenario and cycling_base_state.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_tui/src/main.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added hardscape_area_cm2: 0.0 to TankGeometry struct literal.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/tests/*.rs, crates/tank_scenarios/tests/*.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added hardscape_area_cm2: 0.0 to TankGeometry constructors in 6 test files (tank_size_thermal_response, thermal_reproduction_penalty, concentration_helpers, co2_exchange, substrate_filter_integration, shrimp_population) and fixed one AnimalState field reference in startup_overrides.rs.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": {\n    \"cargo_check\": \"Full workspace compiles with zero errors across all crates (tank_core, tank_data, tank_scenarios, tank_tui, tank_harness, tank_api).\",\n    \"cargo_test\": \"59 tests pass. 1 failure (trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers) is pre-existing and verified to fail identically on the base commit before any habitat changes.\",\n    \"cargo_clippy\": \"Zero warnings.\",\n    \"cargo_fmt\": \"All code passes cargo fmt --check.\",\n    \"backward_compat\": \"All new fields use #[serde(default)] for backward-compatible deserialization. Schema migration v5→v6 is a no-op with post-load fixup to populate habitat_registry for old saves.\",\n    \"invariant_enforcement\": \"Habitat entries are clamped to valid ranges (area≥0, exposures∈[0,1]) in enforce_invariants.\",\n    \"daily_recomputation\": \"Habitat registry is recomputed each daily cycle after plant/algae/microfauna updates, before stability/shrimp systems that may consume habitat data.\"\n  },\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"The specific leaf area constants (40.0 cm²/g for FastStem, 25.0 cm²/g for RootFeedingRosette) are plausible estimates but not literature-calibrated. They determine PlantSurfaces colonizable area and should be validated against empirical data.\",\n    \"The normalized flow formula (flow_lph / volume / 10.0) 